      "html": "<p>It checks that the cameras, access control and alarms work, cover what they should, and behave as designed. It matters for safety, insurance and the law.</p><p>Quickler does not make the system compliant. You or the data protection officer do. It makes the walk easier to record and harder to get wrong.</p>"
